{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42718","headline":"赠怤师 · 王周","name":"赠怤师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水中有片月，照耀婵娟姿。\n庭前有孤栢，竦秀岁寒期。\n坚然物莫迁，寂焉心爲师。\n声发响必荅，形存影即随。\n雪花安结子，雪叶宁附枝。\n兰死不改香，井寒岂生澌。\n晨鑪烟褭褭，病发霜丝丝。\n丈室冰凛冽，一衲云离披。\n顾此名利场，得不慙冠绥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}